    <item>
      <title>화학 섬유 제조의 독특한 강점</title>
      <link>https://docs-acelon-yarn.web.app/ko/competitive-advantages/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://docs-acelon-yarn.web.app/ko/competitive-advantages/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;화학 섬유 제조의 독특한 강점 
    &lt;div id=&#34;화학-섬유-제조의-독특한-강점&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
